Z||000004||FieroJoe||06-25-2001||10:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DecadenceR:<BR><B>$1.37? I wish...<BR>Cheapest near my hosue right now is $1.59, but average is like $1.63 all regular too...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I am very very surprised that it is so cheap too.  I read something in the newspaper about some letter some important congress-person or whatnot wrote to an oil company, and about a week after that letter all the prices started to fall around here.  Who knows, but I'm glad that I get around 30 mpg!||||reg||1
